2026-07-27T08:20:51.0455977Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:20:51.0456622Z i /tmp/RtmpfJFVQH/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:20:51.0457061Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:20:51.0457588Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:20:51.0458409Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:20:51.0459099Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:20:51.0460132Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:20:51.0460951Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:20:51.0735499Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:51.0850221Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:51.1345509Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:51.1538766Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
